OL,4,CCouncil criticised after submitting    
OL,5,Caccounts 22 months late                
OL,6,GA Scottish council has been strongly   
OL,7,Gcriticised by a spending watchdog for  
OL,8,G"undermining transparency and          
OL,9,Gaccountability" after consistently     
OL,10,Gmissing deadlines for reporting its    
OL,11,Gfinances.                              
OL,13,FEast Dunbartonshire's 2023/24 audit    
OL,14,Fwas completed nearly two years after   
OL,15,Fthe statutory deadline, something the  
OL,16,FAccounts Commission said posed "a      
OL,17,Fsignificant risk" to decision-making,  
OL,18,Fsuch as deciding budgets without up-to 
OL,19,Fdate information.                      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
